WEBVTT

00:00:00.581 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.292 --> 00:00:04.715
Got a favourite salon, and want to know as soon as they have an offer,

00:00:04.665 --> 00:00:05.390
or a new look?

00:00:05.658 --> 00:00:06.750
Just tap Follow.

00:00:06.957 --> 00:00:11.310
I'll show you how to follow a salon, read your feed, and buy the salon's products.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:15.721
Open the salon's page, and tap Follow, just below Book now.

00:00:16.227 --> 00:00:18.521
The button changes to Following, and that's it.

00:00:19.125 --> 00:00:22.295
From now on, the salon's new posts appear in your Feed.

00:00:22.661 --> 00:00:24.855
Tap your name at the top, and choose Feed.

00:00:25.309 --> 00:00:29.655
Here you'll find offers, new looks, and news from the salons you follow.

00:00:29.997 --> 00:00:31.015
See an offer you like?

00:00:31.138 --> 00:00:33.015
Tap Book now, under the post.

00:00:33.554 --> 00:00:35.574
Does the salon sell care products?

00:00:35.815 --> 00:00:38.134
On the salon's page, tap Products.

00:00:38.488 --> 00:00:40.054
The salon's shop opens.

00:00:40.238 --> 00:00:41.174
See something you like?

00:00:41.522 --> 00:00:45.574
Tap the bag icon on the photo, then tap the bag at the bottom of the screen.

00:00:46.201 --> 00:00:48.943
Tap Continue to checkout, and choose how to pay:

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:51.939
at the salon when you collect, by bank transfer,

00:00:51.889 --> 00:00:54.063
or agree it with the salon over chat.

00:00:54.348 --> 00:00:56.783
Add a note if you like, and tap Place order.

00:00:56.966 --> 00:00:59.503
The salon will contact you to arrange collection.

00:00:59.599 --> 00:01:01.023
Now take the quiz below!
